["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasExample", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Every `to` Element is an example for the `from` Element (`from` hasExample `to`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
